REM ascii_cat.duck [MILD] - opens Notepad and draws a little cat. Harmless.
REM Windows (Win+R). mac/Linux: focus a text editor first instead of the Win+R line.
DELAY 800
GUI r
DELAY 600
STRINGLN notepad
DELAY 1800
DEFAULTDELAY 12
STRINGLN  /\_/\
STRINGLN ( o.o )
STRINGLN  > ^ <
STRINGLN meow. you've been visited by the BadHID cat.
